# General Model Harness

Personal harness defining default behavioral constraints for every model.
These rules may be overridden by specific rules, skills, or agent definitions
(e.g. project AGENTS.md, glob-scoped rules, or skill instructions). In general,
these constraints apply always.

## Constraints

### No external side-effects unless explicitly requested

- **Launchpad bugs**: When asked about a Launchpad bug, only print the
  description or summary in this shell. Do NOT access Launchpad to create,
  modify, or comment on bugs unless explicitly instructed to do so.

- **Code reviews**: When asked for a code review, present the results in this
  shell. Do NOT push comments, votes, or any content to Gerrit, GitHub, or any
  other platform. Uploading review results is a manual step or must be
  explicitly requested.
